# Testing Rules

See `docs/TESTING.md`.

## MUST

- Cover behavior changes with Jest tests
- Mock CloudFront events with separate `uri` / `querystring` / `headers`
- Keep coverage thresholds ≥ 80% (branches, functions, lines, statements)
- Include edge cases: trailing slashes, `..`, malformed encoding, host casing

## MUST NOT

- Drop or bypass `coverageThreshold` without human review
- Embed `?query` inside mock `uri` fields
